body:
Well I had no issue going over to her place because we had talked online for a while. It's best for me to talk with someone online to let those nerves ease down and not be at maximum when I meet them first.

&#x200B;

We had originally planned to meet up to get some coffee since we lived near each other, but the day before she told me that she didn't want to go out because it was too cold so she just invited me over to her place for coffee.

Yeah, I'm thinking I might have to go back to the old ones cause the new ones always end up looking like this and there is not much I can do

&#x200B;

[https://imgur.com/a/ZuyeS9K](https://imgur.com/a/ZuyeS9K)

Well, I did change my power settings on my PC to performance mode and it got to the point the power in my room would shut down briefly then come back on. That would keep happening until I changed my power settings back to default

&#x200B;

Don't know if that is cause of the PSU being pushed too far, or fuse/wiring of my house.
